text.en:
The trick is to copy `raw` into `stable` only once the counter reaches `"11"`; otherwise keep counting. Then drive `clean <= stable;`.
```vhdl
if raw = last then
    if cnt = "11" then stable <= raw;
    else cnt <= cnt + 1; end if;
else
    cnt <= (others => '0'); last <= raw;
end if;
```

